  "reading": {
    "id": "n4.l01.r01",
    "lessonId": "n4.l01",
    "title": "海が見える新しい町での暮らし (Life in a New Seaside Town)",
    "level": "N4",
    "text": "先月、海の近くの新しいマンションに引っ越しました。この町は自然が豊かで、とても静かな環境です。部屋のベランダに出ると、青い海と美しい景色がはっきり見えます。朝早く窓を開けると、心地よい波の音や鳥の声が聞こえて、毎日とても気持ちよく起きられます。\n\nまた、生活も思ったより便利です。先週、駅の近くに大きなスーパーが建ちました。そこでは新鮮な魚や野菜が安く買えますし、日用品や生活の道具も何でもそろいます。町の中には広い公園もあって、週末には住民が自由に散歩を楽しめます。\n\n以前住んでいた都会ではビルばかりで空が狭く感じられましたが、ここでは広い海と山が見渡せます。日本語学校の友達を部屋に招待して、この素晴らしい景色を見せてあげたいと思っています。",
    "kanaText": "先月、海の近くの新しいマンションに引っ越しました。この町は自然が豊かで、とても静かな環境です。部屋のベランダに出ると、青い海と美しい景色がはっきり見えます。朝早く窓を開けると、心地よい波の音や鳥の声が聞こえて、毎日とても気持ちよく起きられます。\n\nまた、生活も思ったより便利です。先週、駅の近くに大きなスーパーが建ちました。そこでは新鮮な魚や野菜が安く買えますし、日用品や生活の道具も何でもそろいます。町の中には広い公園もあって、週末には住民が自由に散歩を楽しめます。\n\n以前住んでいた都会ではビルばかりで空が狭く感じられましたが、ここでは広い海と山が見渡せます。日本語学校の友達を部屋に招待して、この素晴らしい景色を見せてあげたいと思っています。",
    "translation": "Last month, I moved into a new apartment near the sea. This town is rich in nature and has a very peaceful environment. When I step out onto the room balcony, the blue ocean and beautiful scenery can be seen clearly. Opening the window early in the morning, the pleasant sound of waves and birds' voices can be heard, allowing me to wake up feeling refreshed every day.\n\nDaily life is also more convenient than expected. Last week, a large supermarket was built near the station. Fresh fish and vegetables can be bought cheaply there, and everyday goods and tools are readily available. There is also a spacious park in town where residents can freely enjoy strolls on weekends.\n\nIn the city where I lived previously, there were only tall buildings and the sky felt narrow, but here one can look out over the wide sea and mountains. I would like to invite my Japanese language school friends over to show them this wonderful view.",
    "questionIds": [
      "n4.l01.q021",
      "n4.l01.q022",
      "n4.l01.q023",
      "n4.l01.q024",
      "n4.l01.q025"
    ],
    "difficulty": 2,
    "glossary": [],
    "prov": {
      "source": "Nihongo N2 Master Editorial Team (Native Review)",
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
      "rev": 2
    },
    "titleMy": "海が見える新しい町での暮らし (Life in a New Seaside Town) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "海が見える新しい町での暮らし (Life in a New Seaside Town) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Last month, I moved into a new apartment near the sea. This town is rich in nature and has a very peaceful environment. When I step out onto the room balcony, the blue ocean and beautiful scenery can be seen clearly. Opening the window early in the morning, the pleasant sound of waves and birds' voices can be heard, allowing me to wake up feeling refreshed every day.\n\nDaily life is also more convenient than expected. Last week, a large supermarket was built near the station. Fresh fish and vegetables can be bought cheaply there, and everyday goods and tools are readily available. There is also a spacious park in town where residents can freely enjoy strolls on weekends.\n\nIn the city where I lived previously, there were only tall buildings and the sky felt narrow, but here one can look out over the wide sea and mountains. I would like to invite my Japanese language school friends over to show them this wonderful view."
