    {
      "id": "n4.l12.g002",
      "lessonId": "n4.l12",
      "pattern": "[Causer] は [Causee] を [Verb 使役形 (〜せる/〜させる)]",
      "meaning": "Intransitive Causative (making or allowing someone to perform an intransitive motion or emotion)",
      "formation": "[Causer] は [Causee] を [自動詞 使役形] (走らせる・行かせる・泣かせる・笑わせる)",
      "explanation": {
        "en": "With intransitive verbs (verbs without a direct object like 行く, 走る, 泣く, 笑う), the causee is marked with を. If emotional, it means causing someone to feel that emotion (泣かせる = make cry, 笑わせる = make laugh).",
        "my": "ကံမလိုကြိယာများ (Intransitive verbs) တွင် ပြုလုပ်စေသူက ပြုလုပ်သူကို「を」ဖြင့် ပြသည်။ ဥပမာ- ကလေးကို ငိုစေသည် (子供を泣かせる)။"
      },
      "examples": [
        {
          "sentenceId": "n4.l12.s002",
          "note": "His funny joke made everyone laugh."
