    "titleMy": "新天地での生活と健康への誓い (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "新天地での生活と健康への誓い (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Last month, receiving an official order from my company, it was decided that I will transfer to the Fukuoka branch starting in October. For me, having lived in Tokyo for five years since joining the company, leaving a familiar city is a bit lonely, but I view it positively as a great opportunity to take on new challenges in a fresh environment.\n\nUpon starting my new life in Fukuoka, I decided to fundamentally re-examine my lifestyle habits. Back when I was in Tokyo, when overtime continued, I tended to ruin my health by eating greasy midnight snacks late at night and lacking exercise.\n\nTherefore, in Fukuoka I decided to \"wake up at 6:00 every morning and run along the nearby coast for 30 minutes\" and \"cook my own vegetable-focused meals on weekday evenings.\" Furthermore, I make it a rule to use the company stairs without riding the elevator.\n\nAt the company, every Wednesday is designated as \"No Overtime Day,\" and everyone is scheduled to leave the office by 6:00 PM. Securing my personal time well, I intend to live fulfilling days balancing both work and health."
